evokes a different and complex emotional response. From lush jungles, oceans teeming with life and snakes preparing to strike, to more electronic frontiers like bustling neon streets and the endless expanse of outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/b348af93057c622fa9788b7f382d2e39.avif?t=1774037826\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras_big/b348af93057c622fa9788b7f382d2e39.avif?t=1774037826 width=800 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.poster.avif?t=1774037826\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.webm?t=1774037826\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/d90fee17384bbce4fc75210f8b175420.mp4?t=1774037826\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger the new Burst mechanic to stop a matched Square from clearing. Build it as large as you can until time runs out. When the Timeline starts clearing again, enjoy the show as screen-clearing combos rack up massive points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/62fbd2be99c99efe3f5284e3c45ae2c8.avif?t=1774037826\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras_big/62fbd2be99c99efe3f5284e3c4